        "content": "## 11 — SEO Pipeline\nSPECIALIST AGENT execution, one execution per task.\n\n**Agents:** SEO Specialist (+ Metadata, Schema, Internal Link and Local SEO checkers), Local SEO Specialist.\n\nStart → pre-execution tools (real audits) → Model Router → Context Builder (only what this task needs) → Key Manager / 55 RPM limiter → NVIDIA call → structured-output review (schema, files, sub-agents, review gates) → next stage. Failures go to the Error / Retry Manager.",
